{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36748","headline":"封禅寺居 · 罗隐","name":"封禅寺居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛礼何由覩，嘉名偶寄居。\n周南太史泪，蛮徼长卿书。\n砌竹摇风直，庭花泣露疎。\n谁能赋秋兴，千里隔吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《瀛奎律髓》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/瀛奎律髓_(四庫全書本)）"}